Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:45.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:48.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:50.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}亮出利爪的那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}又想要用它去守護誰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}武器既可傷害也能保護
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:59.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}人生不正如這般的雙向交流嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:04.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}就算約定似隱似現 無人再能知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:08.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}也要一心遵守 度過烈火焦灼夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.89,0:22:11.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}無知狂笑著引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.66,0:22:14.36,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}任昔日萬象掌舵方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:17.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}情緒染上呼出的濕氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:20.28,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我無意在一無所知中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.99,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}讓它們被你掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:26.97,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}審視腦內想像後回歸自我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:33.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}正解的逼迫是渴望將我吞食殆盡的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:37.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}別再繼續阻擋我的道路了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:45.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我絕不會被你所描繪出的理想扼殺
