Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:30.56,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你那扭曲的欲望 把我們拖入了混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:34.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}誤入歧途 分道揚鑣 一去不回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:38.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:41.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
