Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只餘灰燼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:52.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}當天地萬物消失無蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你才會想傾聆我們的聲音
